    "promptProse": "A fine stream from Sakura’s green watering can reaches the flowers beside the Emiya garden wall. She supports the can with one hand on the handle and the other beneath its body, then turns her face toward the viewer without redirecting the water from the flower bed. Her school blazer, red bow and pleated skirt retain the selected uniform, and a light breeze moves the red ribbon in her purple hair. Clear daylight catches droplets above the leaves. Frame the supported can, gentle head turn and garden plants together, with no lettering.",
